Woohoo!

After about three years of playing Nethack,
I've finally ascended! Gaah, what a huge game
it was. I think that I had plenty of good
fortune as well :)

This was my first time into the elemental
(and astral) planes so it was an adventure!

Here's a couple of interesting points:

  - Jubilex was rather easy... he was already dead!
Not sure how I managed this, but it was a bones
level - this was actually my "big break" because I
managed to pick up something like 3 magic
markers that hadn't been re-charged, and heaps
of other goodies like rings and scrolls.

  - I played this game over a period of four weeks.
Including last night, when I went to bed just as
I landed on the astral plane! (It was too late
and I would have made a stupid mistake!)

  - I've uploaded a screenshot of the winning
move here:

http://www.metaltheater.com/pics/ascension2.png

  - I managed to kill Rodney 6 times, including
when he cast "Double Trouble". The last time
he had stolen my amulet, and I was hovering over
some water (Medusa level I think). So I had to
drop everything and dive in :)

  - I think that I was very fortunate on the
Elemental planes. I didn't have any portal detection
devices except for the amulet. Somehow I didn't have
any trouble with water elementals and I even managed to
kill one.. somehow! I think that the ring of conflict
made my life a lot easier :)

  - I killed 5 master mind flayers before genociding them :)

  - I killed death twice, both times with my cleaver,
however he wasn't guarding my altar. Famine was,
and I didn't have to deal with Pestilence :)

  - On the Astral Plane, I walked into into a doorframe
and was confronted by famine! There were ants behind me
and my food was in a bag. Took a crazy swing and killed
him with one hit! Using only my basic +5 Cleaver! I think
that my ring of conflict must have made my life a bit easier :)

  - This was the first time I'd ever seen an Archon - putting
a towel over my eyes made things a lot easier!

  - Never had an amulet of life saving :) (Or a ring of
regeneration)

  - Never wrote Elbereth :)

  - Didn't polymorph anything, including myself. Never really
had the need to (but I'm not really against it... as yet)

  - Got a score of 4325374 - my best so far!

  - Took 81943 moves - how does that stack up?

  - 183 HP (could have sworn it was more like 210 at one point)

  - Character was level 22, AC -29, St 25, Dx 18, Co 18,
In 17, Wi 18, Ch 16. I don't think that I ever casted any
spells (except to make me confused when neccesary)

  - I forgot to make a copy of my inventory to note down.

  - One thing I've never worked out. How do you
take only 1 item out of a bag? If it's stacked?

Anyway, big big thanks to the DevTeam for creating
an awesome game, and a big thanks to everyone on
r.g.r.n - I think I spent just as much time googling
for nethack info as I spent actually playing the game :)

